<!-- Adaptive-icon foreground for Eh!Iptv. The full launcher icon (TV +
     two silhouettes) is exported as a bitmap; cropping out the wordmark
     keeps the mark intact when Android scales the foreground into the
     inner 66% safe zone. -->
